            "review_title": "Review at Thílá Cafe & Bistro",
            "review_text": "Cathy Kennedy\nIndialantic, Florida73 contributions\n0\nGreat find in Danang!\nMar 2026 • Couples\nThis is a beautiful and clean restaurant with great breakfast and dinner choices. We stayed nearby while in Danang for a few days and this is definitely a go to restaurant. We also saw some digital nomads hanging out in the afternoon with coffee and pastries when we passed by. \n\nFor beverages, I had a ginger coconut tea and my husband had a mango passion fruit smoothie. For dinner, I had the vegetable rolls with noodles and my husband had a vegetable pho with tofu. Suitable portions, delicious and nice blend of flavors. We loved it and would highly recommend. Staff were very friendly but I did have to use google translate a few times but honestly I should try to learn more Vietnamese! \n\nWe also split chocolate cake for dessert and it was divine!\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2026",
